{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》主要演員包括：楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤、鄺潔楹等。</p><p>昨晚（24日）播出的第十一集「同局異心」，傅嘉莉、林夏薇、姚子羚被加入神秘群組，令三人「鬼打鬼」彼此猜忌。</p><p>另邊廂，楊茜堯終向馬國明坦</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:24:00.557913+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T11:17:17.642304+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:17:17.642304+00:00","content_hash":"71c10016f90d550de0b9b5d616cf4bdf8e414251ede48483cbeae602283dfb92","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}